  'The outside-Navan and over-cap approvals are linked. The lodging is modeled as <b>tax ready</b>, subject to final tax-adviser review.':'Navan 外预订及超限审批已关联。该住宿在演示中标记为<b>税务凭证齐备</b>，最终仍需税务顾问复核。',
  'For U.S. expenses, receipts are required above $50; outside the U.S., receipts are required for every expense. Receipts must show vendor, date, items, and subtotal/tax. Claims older than 90 days require manager approval.':'美国超过 50 美元的费用须提供收据；美国境外每笔费用均须提供收据。收据须显示商户、日期、商品明细、小计和税额。超过 90 天提交须经经理批准。',
  'Travel must be business-critical and pre-approved by a manager. Air, hotel, train, and rental car should be booked through Navan. Domestic airfare should be booked 14 days ahead; international airfare 21 days ahead. Prices more than 20% over Navan Dynamic Policy are flagged.':'差旅须为业务所需并事先获得经理批准。机票、酒店、火车和租车应通过 Navan 预订。国内机票应提前 14 天预订，国际机票应提前 21 天。价格超过 Navan 动态政策 20% 以上将被标记。',
